  SELECTED: subsample=0.85, colsample_bytre=0.85, reg_alpha=0.1, reg_lambda=1.2

  RATIONALE:
  - subsample=0.85 > 0.7 or 1.0: Keeps most rows per tree while adding
    diversity; 0.7 loses too much signal from rare medicines
  - colsample_bytree=0.85 > 0.7 or 1.0: Prevents any single feature
    dominating; 0.7 loses too many features per tree
  - reg_lambda=1.2 > default 1.0: Slightly stronger L2 shrinkage
    needed for synthetic data; 2.0+ starts underfitting
  - reg_alpha=0.1: Mild L1 gives implicit feature selecion without
    dominating the L2 shrinkage
